@bank all
// SW1 (2026-10-25, patch 0.92.6 items 18, 14 and 11, for FX19's worksText): the first promotion made obvious.
// SW2 re-voice (2026-10-25, the user's change at 05:25 UTC: "Test job should be the day after getting Reliable."): the
// Tier 1 steps are New, Steady, Reliable, Trusted, Relied on; the Tier 2 test now needs Reliable and Calder's Making it
// safe (which she runs from Day 8), and is never before Day 9. The offer comes the moment both hold; the test is your
// next workday. Calder speaks unless noted: exact, numbers not adjectives, never "well done" (her arc's payoff) and no
// "!". Mails are "Subject | body", unsigned (the game adds the sender). Each beat fires once.

// toasts, said by nobody, when your reputation word changes at Tier 1 ({band})
== works.rep.up.steady
- Now Steady. One more step, Reliable, and you're up for your Tier 2 test.
== works.rep.up.reliable
- Now Reliable. That's the reputation your Tier 2 test needs.
// RETIRED (0.92.6, the test moved to Reliable; key not reused):
// == works.rep.up.trusted
// - Up to Trusted. One more step, Relied on, and you're up for your Tier 2 test.

// Calder, at Reliable while Making it safe isn't done, if she's near (a bubble); else the Mail
== promo.sight
- Reliable. Good. One thing left: Making it safe, with me. Then I put you up for Tier 2.
- Reliable now. That's the reputation. Making it safe with me, and then your test.
== promo.sight.mail
- Next step | Reliable. One thing left: Making it safe, with me, from Day 8. Then Tier 2.

// RETIRED (0.92.6; key not reused): Calder, at Trusted
// == promo.trusted
// - Trusted. One more step. Then we talk about your test.

// the big beat: Reliable + Making it safe + Day 9 or later (her bubble; promo.announce follows it)
== promo.ready
- Reliable. Making it safe, done. That's all of it. Your Tier 2 test is your next workday.
// the Mail, always ({day}: a weekday or "tomorrow")
== promo.ready.mail
- Your Tier 2 test | Ready. Test job {day}, 09:00, Works bay. Pass it and you're an Officer.
// the device's urgent notice ({day})
== promo.ready.notice
- Your Tier 2 test: {day}, 09:00, the Works bay.

// RETIRED (0.92.6: the offer now waits for both, so neither "almost" Mail is sent; keys not reused):
// == promo.missing.m6
// - Almost | Relied on. One thing left before your Tier 2 test: Making it safe, with me.
// == promo.missing.day
// - Soon | You're ready early. I set Tier 2 tests from the second Monday. We'll talk then.

// the Record's "What's next" while you're below Reliable ({band} now, {next} the next step's word)
// (next.t2.rep stays next.lines' own switch-off line: it's given {band} only, so a {next} here would show as written; FX19)
== next.t2.steps
- Your Tier 2 test needs Reliable and Making it safe. You're {band} now.

// the Works app's Training tab, "Your promotion" checklist
== works.promo.check.title
- Your promotion: the Tier 2 test
== works.promo.check.day
- The test from Day 9
== works.promo.check.rep
- Reliable (you're {band})
== works.promo.check.m6
- Making it safe, with the Chief
== works.promo.check.set
- Test job: {day}, 09:00
== works.promo.check.done
- Done
== works.promo.check.not
- Not yet

// Calder's Mail, the first time your ship-wide work reputation turns dependable (sent only before Reliable)
== promo.dependable
- Dependable | Word is you're dependable. Reach Reliable at work, and we'll talk Tier 2.

// optional (item 11): the chip on board jobs of a kind you're trained in
== works.board.trade
- Your trade

// Your new cabin after the promotion (the user: "new quarters can't be missed"). Said by nobody.
// the urgent notice as the walk to cabin 4-23 starts ({name}: who walks you there)
== promo.move.notice
- Your own cabin, 4-23: {name} is walking you there now.
// the cabin's title on the device
== promo.home.title
- Your cabin
// when the cabin became yours without the walk (you weren't there by 22:00)
== promo.home.notice
- Cabin 4-23 is yours now. Your bed and your things are there. Officers' corridor, Deck 4.
// the arrow's label
== promo.home.arrow
- Your cabin, 4-23. Your things are in.
// the Works app's Training tab line
== works.promo.home
- Your cabin: 4-23, on the officers' corridor, Deck 4.
